Value Behavior <code>nil</code> Encoded as <code>null</code> <code>math.huge</code> / <code>-math.huge</code> / <code>NaN</code> Encoded as <code>null</code> (not an error, silently becomes null) function / userdata <code>error</code> on encode Circular table <code>error</code> on encode <p><code>json.null</code> is a special marker; writing it into a table encodes it as <code>null</code> (instead of disappearing as an empty table):</p> <pre><code>local t = {name = "Sans", nick = json.null}
print(json.encode(t))   -- {"name":"Sans","nick":null}
</code></pre>

值​ ​行为​ <code>nil</code> ​编码​为​ <code>null</code> <code>math.huge</code> / <code>-math.huge</code> / <code>NaN</code> ​编码​为​ <code>null</code> （​不是​报错​，​是​静默​变​ null） ​函数​ / userdata ​编码​时​ <code>error</code> ​循环​引用​的​表​ ​编码​时​ <code>error</code> <p><code>json.null</code> ​是​一个​特殊​标记​，​写​进​表里​会​被​编码​成​ <code>null</code> （​而​不是​被​当成​空表​消失​）：</p> <pre><code>local t = {name = "Sans", nick = json.null}
print(json.encode(t))   -- {"name":"Sans","nick":null}
</code></pre>
